DPLL configuration register 0 (DPLL = PERI_CRG_PLL4/PERI_CRG_PLL5), same layout as PERI_CRG_PLL0. Reset: postdiv2 = 1, postdiv1 = 2; with PERI_CRG_PLL5 (refdiv 6, fbdiv 233) FOUTVCO = 24 x 233 / 6 = 932 MHz and POSTDIV = 466 MHz (the `DPLL POSTDIV (maximum 466 MHz)` choice of ddr_clksel).

Data sheet 3.2.7 PERI_CRG_PLL4 (offset 0x10, printed page 3-15, `hi3519v101--Hi3519V101-Datasheet.txt` line 4636).";

