        desc = "PERI_CRG49 is an MMC0/1/2 clock and soft reset control register.

MMC0/MMC1/MMC2 clock and reset. Header total reset 0x0002_0200 but the rows give 0x0002_0202: mmc1_clken (bit 1) resets to 1 in the rows; mmc0_clken and mmc2_clken are 1 in both. The row value is used (DS inconsistency, low confidence; no vendor code depends on it). mmc*_clk_mode must be set to 1 (divided by 8, 16-phase tuning) before use; mmc*_clksel selects the source clock (000 = 100 MHz, 001 = 198, 011 = 396, 100 = 594, 101 = 792, 111 = 1188 MHz; 010 and 110 reserved), the actual MMC clock is the source divided by 8.

